</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Having now been reconciled we will be saved,</l><l>Through God’s gift of righteousness, partake of grace;</l><l>Jesus Christ, this gracious gift, to us has come,</l><l>And abounding richly to all in the Son!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Much more life to those in Christ who have believed,</l><l>With the gift of righteousness, much grace received,</l><l>Reign in life and with the Lord always be found,</l><l>Ruling, reigning in His life more grace abounds.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Reign in life in Christ with su’pra-bounding grace,</l><l>All our nat’ral life, with Christ, will be replaced;</l><l>We can reign with Christ unto eternal life;</l><l>In God’s kingdom, manifested, shining bright!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
